## 📥 BULK UPLOAD FORMAT

### Example JSON Structure:
```json
[
  {
    "id": "prod-001",
    "name": "Product Name",
    "description": "Product description here",
    "price": 99.99,
    "image": "https://example.com/image.jpg",
    "category": "software",
    "type": "digital",
    "status": "available",
    "auction": {
      "isAuction": false,
      "startingBid": null,
      "currentBid": null,
      "endDate": null
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "prod-002",
    "name": "Auction Item",
    "description": "This is an auction item",
    "price": 50.00,
    "image": "https://example.com/auction.jpg",
    "category": "hardware",
    "type": "physical",
    "status": "available",
    "auction": {
      "isAuction": true,
      "startingBid": 50.00,
      "currentBid": 75.00,
      "endDate": "2025-12-31T23:59:59"
    }
  }
]
```

### Required Fields:
- `id` - Unique product identifier (string)
- `name` - Product name (string)
- `description` - Product description (string)
- `price` - Price in USD (number)
- `image` - Image URL (string)
- `category` - Must be: software, hardware, services, vintage, or crypto
- `type` - Must be: physical or digital
- `status` - Must be: available, sold, or coming-soon
- `auction` - Auction object (required, even if not an auction)

### Auction Fields (optional):
- `isAuction` - true/false
- `startingBid` - Starting bid amount (number or null)
- `currentBid` - Current highest bid (number or null)
- `endDate` - ISO date string (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ss) or null

