## 💡 TIPS

1. **Backup Regularly** - Use Export tab to save your data
2. **Unique IDs** - Always use unique product IDs
3. **Image URLs** - Use reliable image hosting (Imgur, CloudFlare, etc.)
4. **Auction Dates** - Use ISO format for dates
5. **Test First** - Try adding one product before bulk upload

